### 1. Crear Alumno (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/alumnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "12345678A",
  "nombre": "Carlos",
  "apellidos": "García Pérez",
  "fechaNacimiento": "2002-05-14",
  "telefonoUno": "600112233",
  "telefonoDos": "954001122",
  "emailUno": "carlos.garcia@altair.edu",
  "emailDos": null
}

### 2. Consultar Todos los Alumnos (GET)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/alumnos

### 3. Actualizar Alumno (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/alumnos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "12345678A",
  "nombre": "Carlos Manuel",
  "apellidos": "García Pérez",
  "fechaNacimiento": "2002-05-14",
  "telefonoUno": "600112233",
  "telefonoDos": "611223344",
  "emailUno": "carlos.garcia@altair.edu",
  "emailDos": "carlos.personal@email.com"
}

### 4. Probar DNI Duplicado (POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/alumnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dni": "12345678A",
  "nombre": "Otro Nombre",
  "apellidos": "García Pérez",
  "fechaNacimiento": "2002-05-14",
  "telefonoUno": "600112233",
  "telefonoDos": null,
  "emailUno": "otro.email@altair.edu",
  "emailDos": null
}

### 5. Eliminar Alumno (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/alumnos/1